flowchart TD
    U[User / Client] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> IDX[POST /index]
    API --> S[GET /search]
    API --> Q[POST /ask]
    API --> E[POST /extract]
    S --> H[Phase 5 Hybrid Search]
    H --> QD[Qdrant Dense Search]
    H --> ES[Elasticsearch BM25]
    H --> RRF[RRF Fusion]
    RRF --> CE[Cross-Encoder Reranker]
    Q --> LG[Phase 6 LangGraph]
    E --> LG
    IDX --> LG
    LG --> RET[Retrieval Agent]
    RET --> H
    LG --> SP[Specialist Extraction Agents]
    SP --> ADD[Addendum Reconciliation]
    ADD --> VAL[Validator / Retry Loop]
    VAL --> OUT[Bid JSON + Trace]
    Q --> LOG[Sample Q&A Log + Citations]
